Package: CGExplorer
Type: Package
Title: Chemo-Genomic Screening Data Preprocessor and Visualizer
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Qingzhou Zhang", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "zqzneptune@hotmail.com")
Description: An R package providing S4 data structures, analysis methods, and a Shiny
    application for preprocessing, quality control, and chemo-genomic interaction scoring
    of 384-well plate screening datasets generated by Tecan plate readers.
    Plate data is managed via a persistent local registry (PlateRegistry S4 object)
    that accumulates across sessions and survives package upgrades.
